msgid ""
"The OOP is claimed by a person on maternity, paternity or parental leave. "
"DoVP and DoPČ only, RLZEC 2027 and later."
msgstr ""
"OOP si uplatňuje osoba na materskej, otcovskej alebo rodičovskej dovolenke. "
"Len pri DoVP a DoPČ, od vzoru RLZEC 2027."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_rlfo
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_rlfo/models/l10n_sk_rlfo.py:0
