"The event of '%(name)s' marks the OOP as claimed on the ground of leave but "
"has no date the claim was notified."
msgstr ""
"Udalosť zamestnanca '%(name)s' označuje OOP ako uplatnenú z dôvodu "
"dovolenky, ale chýba dátum oznámenia uplatnenia."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_rlfo
